Minimal example of the BEP044 stimulus organization:
a /stimuli directory with subdirectories, a dataset-wide stimuli.tsv at the
/stimuli root, a scoped stimuli.tsv in faces/ that amends it (Inheritance
Principle), stimulus annotations, and events.tsv files referencing stimuli
through the stim_id column.

The stimuli/nsd/ subdirectory is a self-contained stimulus pack for the
Natural Scenes Dataset (NSD) shared1000 images: a scoped stimuli.tsv with
LLM-generated image descriptions and quality-controlled HED annotations.
The images themselves are not redistributed (present: false); the catalog
and annotations remain usable on their own and the pack can be copied
between datasets as one unit.
